('fixed','先定中心與寬度，再固定特徵','Set centres and widths, then fix the features','本課流程先用 K-means，再只求輸出權重。','This course fixes features after K-means, then fits output weights.','§1 RBF流程','Kmeans至固定高斯至可訓練線性輸出，標籤只進輸出求解','gate','work','先把旗子\n插在資料附近。','Place the flags\nnear the data.'),
('linear','非線性換座標，線性組合輸出','Nonlinear features, linear output weights','輸出對權重是線性的，對原始輸入可非線性。','The output is linear in weights, but can be nonlinear in the input.','§1 輸出式','輸入通往兩高斯再合併線性輸出原生連線','basket','work','彎的是座標，\n學的是權重。','Curved features.\nLinear weights.'),
